<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN SOCCER TO CELIBRATE 40TH ANNIVERSARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN SOCCER TO CELIBRATE 40TH ANNIVERSARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Confederation of African Football (CAF) will mark their 40th anniversary with a special banquet in Cairo on August 19, officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>The low-key celebration will coincide with the traditional mid-year meetings of CAF's various committees, which will be held from August 15-22 at the organisation's headquarters in the Egyptian capital.</p>
